        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Minzi' gali'fuma mu itale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iv'ilingano lyose lya V'aizilaeli lyawu'kaga ku'fuma ku' ibalangu' lya Sini, lyayu'mbaga ku'fuma lwandi' lu'mo mpaka lwandi' lu'ngi' ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' walagi'li'zya. V'atu'u'laga nkambi' yav'o ku' lwandi' lwa Lefidimu, ali'vi kwav'age ku'du'hu' minzi' ga ku'nywa v'antu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yeni'yo v'antu' v'amubu'bu'zyaga Mose na ku'yomba, “Ku'pe minzi' ga ku'nywa,” Nawe Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ku' ki' muli'mbu'bu'zya? Mukav'ile muli'mugema Gu'ku' Mulungu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi v'antu' v'ose v'av'age na nota, v'amwisayi'li'li'laga Mose na ku'yomba ati', “Ku' ki' waku'fumizye ku' Misili na ku'ku'leta ku'no ki'gele ku'fwe na nota, iswe, v'ana v'iswe na mitugo ziswe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wamuli'li'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu na ku'yomba ati', “Mbav'ezezye ki' v'antu' v'enav'a? Gi'si' v'egela ku'ngu'ma na mawe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “V'i'ta ha mbele ya v'antu' v'enav'a. U'sole mugati' na v'anamala v'a Izilaeli, muv'e haki'mo nav'o. U'sole na mulanga gwako u'go ndi' wagu'gu'mi'la mongo gwa Naili, u'ye nago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lingaga, ene nkwi'ma ha mbele yako ku' itale lya bi'hi' na lu'gu'lu' lwa Holebu, nanho u'kali'gu'me itale lyeni'lo na minzi' gaku'fuma, ki'gele v'antu' v'anywe.” Hohene Mose wav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo ha mbele ya v'anamala v'a Izilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Mose wahapaga lina “Masa” na “Meliba,” ku'nguno ya V'aizilaeli ndi' v'amubu'bu'zyaga na ku'mugema Gu'ku' Mulungu na ku'yomba ati', “Vihe, nhana Gu'ku' Mulungu ali' niswe ninga ng'o?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wu'lu'gu' wa V'aizilaeli na V'aamaleki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itungo lyeni'lo V'aamaleki v'izaga na kwigu'ma na V'aizilaeli kwenu'ko ku' Lefidimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose wamuwi'laga Yoswa ati', “Sogola v'agosya v'amo, muye mukigu'me na V'aamaleki. Igolo ene ndi'me ha nsoto ya kalu'gu'lu', ku'no ndimile mulanga gwamwa Mulungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Yoswa wav'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Mose wamuwi'laga, wayaga ku'kigu'ma na V'aamaleki. Nav'o Mose, Aloni na Huli v'aliinaga ha nsoto ya kalu'gu'lu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga itungo lyose i'lo Mose wav'age u'lu' wawu'sya makono gakwe mu igu'lya, V'aizilaeli v'akindage, sumbwa u'lu' wasosya makono gakwe V'aamaleki v'akindage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi aho lyav'i'taga itungo, makono gamwa Mose gadedaga. Haho Aloni haki'mo na Huli, v'asolaga iwe, v'ali'tu'u'laga bi'hi' na Mose, ki'gele ikali'le. Hangi' Aloni na Huli v'agadimaga makono gamwa Mose na ku'gawu'sya mu igu'lya, yu'mo ku' mumoso na yu'ngi' ku' mulyi'la. I'vi hu' vyene makono gamwa Mose gav'aga na nguzu, na gav'aga mu igu'lya mpaka lyu'v'a aho lyalokaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yeni'yo Yoswa wali'kindaga idale lya v'asilikale v'a V'aamaleki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “U'li'tone igambo lyeni'li' mu ki'tabu, ki'gele gu'v'e mwizu', ku'v'a nhana ndav'azimangu'zye V'aamaleki haki'mo na mwizu' gwav'o gu'leke ku'v'a gu'li'ho mu welelo. Hangi' u'li'yombe mu matwi gamwa Yoswa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wazyengaga ihozezyo na ku'litana “Gu'ku' Mulungu ali' Bendela Yanne",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina “Gu'ku' Mulungu ali' Bendela Yanne” ku' Ki'ebulania gu'li' “Yahweh-nisi.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wayombaga, “Muwu'sye mu igu'lya bendela yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Muhayo “Muwu'sye mu igu'lya bendela yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu” ku' Ki'ebulania gu'li' “Mukono ku' bendela yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu” ninga “Mukono ku' isumbi' lya wu'temi lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Gu'ku' Mulungu aku'v'a na wu'lu'gu' na V'aamaleki mugati' na wu'v'yalwa wav'o wose u'wo wu'lalonde!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
